# Word Pairing: Category Match — .clinerules

## Project Overview

**Name:** Word Pairing: Category Match  
**Type:** React + TypeScript + Capacitor Android app  
**Description:** A sleek, dark-mode word association puzzle game where players group related word tiles to solve categories across multiple game modes.  
**Package:** com.snickerdoodlez.wordpairing  
**Repository:** git@github.com:snickerdoodlez-games/android.git  
**License:** ISC

---

## Tech Stack

- **Framework:** React 19 + TypeScript 5.8
- **Bundler:** Vite 6
- **Mobile:** Capacitor 7 (Android)
- **Animation:** Framer Motion 11.15
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS (via CDN in index.html)
- **Ads:** @capacitor-community/admob
- **Font:** Oswald (Google Fonts)
- **UI Theme:** Neon arcade color scheme with dark background

---

## Build & Run Commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `npm install` | Install all dependencies |
| `npm run dev` | Start Vite dev server (port 3000) |
| `npm run build` | Production build to `dist/` |
| `npm run preview` | Preview production build |

